* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RTRARP  - Trace processing of a job's sysout dataset
*
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* mrs 93-05-13 s(999999) rewritten
* mrs 93-05-13 s(999999) show correct mask
* mrs 93-10-26 s(999999) add steplib corrected
* mrs 93-12-17 s(999999) some api fields not filled
* mrs 94-03-04 s(999999) BS2
* mrs 94-11-04 s(212611) check for p-repname = blank
* gw  98-08-03 p(172644) account for newpage x'81' EBCDIC CC
* jvd 98-09-10 p(164220) NOM141ÖNAT23
* jvd 99-04-21 p(181377) NAT1305 when > 10m lines
* fhi 00-03-03 S(192651) Line length > 253 not stored in DB
* sju 00-03-24 p(191368) use N-HEADER instead of C-HEADER
* xsiszha 2000-08-15 (CE7461) Extend Report and Bundle Names
* fhi     2003-07-29 P(227985) Clear unused modules
* xsetggr 03-11-27 p(246658) correct existance check of steplib
* fhi     2005-04-14   NOM3107 Added Support for 7 byte jobnumbers
* fhi     2005-06-23 p(266530) Make Monitor NPR Mainframe independent
* xsetggr 2005-11-28 p(271774) tolerate more than 40 Power segments
*                              (only 40 will be traced)
* xsetggr 2007-05-02 NOM3201   support 5 byte node numbers
* xsetggr 2007-09-04 NOM3201   support P11 format run numbers
* xsetggr 2007-11-19 NRT2766   correct adding of steplib
* xsetggr 2008-01-15 p(300297) record lemgth of some ESY views is N5
* xsetggr 2009-02-24 P300323   make steplib handling unix compliant
* xsetggr 2010-11-29 NOMALL-908
* raya    2011-12-29 nomall-98 check member to avoid err 82
* raya    2013-01-09 NOMALL-1214 check cat date of user exit
* raya    2013-01-09 NOMALL-1214 check cat date of user exit
* SU1     2014-08-14 NOMALL-1447 TEST files > 16k - only restruct
* SU2    2014-11-17 NOMALL-1450 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* SU3     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* SU4     2016-08-02 NOMALL-1518 NOM3.5 deactivate opt.Compiler
* fhi     2017-01-18 NOMALL-1916 Use binary NPR RECORD* fields
* fhi     2017-01-27 NOMALL-1961 Show node name in errors
* fhi     2017-07-11 NOMALL-2021 NPR error: use RECORD temporarily ÜÜÜ
* SU5     2019-12-03 NOMALL-2358 sep. exit called with empty line
* SU6     2020-05-18 NOMALL-2349 use N-CHKCAT
* SU7     2021-07-26 NOMALL-2480 BS2: show correct map(not JES2)
* SU8/BLI 2021-10-15 ES-31134    Unix:BS2:use ESA transl/no hex
* SU9     2021-10-27 NOMALL-2504 update time on map
* SU10    2024-03-07 ES-34613    NOM 3.6 Remove power / BS2
************************************************************************
*
DEFINE DATA GLOBAL USING NRM-GL
