1 STEPLIB-ADDED            (L)
1 #STEPLIB-EXIST           (L)
1 #USERID                  (A8)
1 #CAT-DATE-1              (A10)
1 #CAT-DATE-2              (A10)
1 #P-RECNO-OLD             (N9)
